<p>Makes a creature be perceived as long as its within the outer perception radius
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> TriggerPerception(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oPerceivingCreature,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oPerceivedCreature<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oPerceivingCreature<dd>The creature that will see another creature<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oPerceivedCreature<dd>The creature that is being seen
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
<p><dd>TRUE if the creature is percieved, FALSE otherwise
</p>
</dl><dl><dt>Source:
<p><dd><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Script.ldf" title="Script.ldf">script.ldf</a>
</p>
